 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nZürichsee Handels AG                                              MASTER SERVICES\nIndustriestrasse 55, 8001 Zürich, Switzerland                           AGREEMENT\nMWST-Nr: CHE-240.748.249 MWST\n\nFROM                                                                    RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nZürichsee Handels AG                                                    Helvetia Präzision AG\nIndustriestrasse 55                                                     Industriestrasse 55\n8001 Zürich                                                             8001 Zürich\nSwitzerland                                                             Switzerland\nVAT: CHE-240.748.249 MWST\n\n                                                           BEZAHLT [circled]\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 20.02.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Zürichsee Handels AG, with its registered office at Industriestrasse 55, Zürich (\"Party A\"), and Helvetia\nPräzision AG, with its registered office at Industriestrasse 55, Zürich (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Zürichsee Handels AG / Claudia Frei\nParty B    Helvetia Präzision AG / Marc Dubois\nDate       20.02.2026",
